--   three REVOKE statements on get_universe_evolution_monitor(uuid) (public, anon, authenticated) that
--   appear in NO ledger payload → OUT-OF-BAND ACL change (LIVE ACL confirms the effect: only postgres
--   and service_role keep EXECUTE).
